  {
   "id": "fading-echo-347887@major-2026-06-05",
   "gameId": "fading-echo-347887",
   "displayName": "The Definitive Demo Update - Patch Notes",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-06-05T14:04:15.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi Legends!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Steam Next Fest is around the corner, starting June 15th — and yes, we’ll be there!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "So we figured it was time to give the Demo a little glow-up before welcoming more of you in. This update brings a revamped Perks screen, new UI and audio improvements, more languages, better performance, and Bob. Yes, Bob.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As always, thank you so much for your support, feedback and suggestions. Big shoutout to our community on Discord helping us keep improving the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Also, important heads-up before you jump back in: old Demo save files won’t work with this update. But this is for the greater good: saves created from this version of the Demo will be compatible with the full release, so you won’t have to replay everything later.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Check out the full changes below, and see you on Corel!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "BOB",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Bob is HERE! Meet Bob for the first time!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Test out your perks on him",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Play around with the systemic elements (Bob will respawn as a new element each time)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Don’t worry about killing him, he will come back every time",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "SAVE SYSTEM",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "All old save files will no longer work",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Save file compatibility for the full release of the game - no need to replay!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "PERKS SCREEN",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Overhaul of entire screen, removing all placeholder visuals",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Clearer connection between islands and perks",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Each perk now has it’s own unique icon and video preview",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Understand archetypes better, with a colour coded system",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "GAMEPLAY",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Vault kicks won’t send you off cliffs anymore - show gravity who’s boss",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added further control over dash direction",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Statues in the Volcano",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "LOCALISATION",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Brazilian Portuguese is now available! Experience the whole game with both voice acting and subtitles",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated text on all languages - thanks to everyone who has provided us with feedback!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New languages available for subtitles",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Traditional Chinese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Simplified Chinese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Japanese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Korean",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "UI",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Clean up of enemy + player health bars",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Take up less space on the screen",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated visuals that are easier to differentiate",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated font to make information clearer",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Potions",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Enemy Introductions",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Island/Reality Introductions",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Lava core is now yellow instead of red",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Radio visuals are now larger and stronger contrast",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Accessibility for subtitles - 3 different sizes now available",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New loading screens, highlighting different characters",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "AUDIO",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Music changes based on the context, such as higher intensity and pace during combat",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Removed ringing when holding a core in water form",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Different sounds for small, medium and large chests",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "CUTSCENES",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Updated timing of subtitles to match the audio",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "All sounds and music have been refined and balanced",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cutscene 3 has been changed to better explain the story",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "OPTIMISATION",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Imposters for all islands to highlight visual quality with better performance",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Grid rendering improvements for AMD graphics cards.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Shorter loading times in portals",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🌊 Flow with us",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "✨ Wishlist Fading Echo",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Steam | Epic Games Store | PlayStation Store | Xbox Store",
